WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,820
If Madam wants to say hello, you might as well wait for another day

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,820
I didn't come here to say hello today, I came specifically to see Miss Ji.

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:08,520
Last time I had a chat with Miss Ji about Shenghuan, and we got along quite well.

4
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:11,320
I have nothing to do today, so I wanted to come and talk to her. Sisters

5
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,020
That's really unlucky

6
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:17,580
My cousin went to the third lady's courtyard early this morning.

7
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,780
That's it, it's inconvenient to change it to another day

8
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:22,180
Prince, let them come in for me

9
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:29,220
Madam Prince, please

10
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,220
I heard that you went back to your parents’ home two days ago

11
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:34,420
Returning to her grandmother, Sun Xi was worried about her sister-in-law's health and went back to see her.

12
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,420
Since you have married into the Hou Mansion, you are a member of the Hou Mansion.

13
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:39,220
From now on, you should live your life with peace of mind and guarding your husband’s family.

14
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,620
Think less about frequent visits to your parents’ family

15
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:44,220
You are becoming more and more capable today

16
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,620
I can't bear to ask you to wait for a while.

17
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:48,620
I can't wait any longer
